or use commercially the code, design or data. The ability to view code granted by the GitHub platform does not grant the
right to copy or reuse it.

The app is unofficial and provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. Signs on site and the official decisions and
price list of the City of Osijek and GPP are authoritative for charging.

Third-party components keep their own licences and are not covered by this licence: Leaflet (js/leaflet.js,
js/LICENSE-leaflet.txt), fonts (fonts/LICENSE-*.txt), Esri map tiles and street geometry © OpenStreetMap contributors.
